    "Industry classification is a current snapshot applied to history, not a point-in-time industry series.",
    "D3 checks every pairwise average monthly cross-sectional rank correlation among the three components; audited values before preregistration were 0.116942, 0.094296 and 0.118635 over 52 months.",
